# DVT media - static IP settings
# Rename this file to ip.txt. When ip.txt exists, WinPE tries this
# static IP first; if its gateway test fails, it tries DHCP and asks
# whether to continue. Without ip.txt, DHCP is used.
#
# One value per line, in this order:
#   line 1 = ip      : only the first three octets are used; the last
#                      octet is entered on each PC with the disk number
#   line 2 = subnet  : may be omitted (NET_MASK in Media\pe\config.cmd)
#   line 3 = gateway : may be omitted (first three octets of ip + .1)
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Save the file as ANSI / ASCII.
203.244.132.0
255.255.255.0
203.244.132.1
